    <description>A basic mathematics library developed primarily for rendering in 3d and 2d.</description>
    <releaseNotes>API: Add new Monitor Info API (@utkumaden)
Fix WindowState and StartVisible to behave correctly on MS Windows (@seanofw)
Fix scrolling getting lost between frames (@NogginBops)
Fix ContextProfile documentation to be correct (@NogginBops)
Fix Quaternion -&amp;gt; Matrix3/Matrix4 conversions (@NogginBops)
Fix wrong binding code generation on some locales (@ahmetsait)</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
</package>